1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,410
Artificial intelligence becoming self-aware and exterminating the human race is a common theme in science fiction.
人工智能拥有自我意识并灭绝人类，是科幻作品中常见的主题。

2
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:14,490
But the levels of high intelligence that AI could reach is a real concern among some scientists.
但人工智能可能达到的高智能水平，确实引发了一些科学家的担忧。

3
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:22,630
But with more talk of AI and smart devices in the home, what are the positives of bringing these things into your life?
不过，随着人们对人工智能和家用智能设备的讨论越来越多，将这些事物引入生活又有哪些好处呢？

4
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:30,800
Hans Rosling, a professor of international health, once spoke about the impact and changes that the washing machine made.
国际卫生学教授汉斯·罗斯林曾谈及洗衣机带来的影响与变革。

5
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:38,940
The once arduous task of cleaning clothes by hand was taken on by a machine and freed up more time for other activities.
曾经繁重的手工洗衣劳动被机器接手，人们得以腾出更多时间投入其他活动。

6
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:42,910
There are so many smart devices that you can fill your home with.
如今，有各种各样的智能设备可以进驻家庭。

7
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:52,950
Imagine waking up to find a piping hot, freshly brewed cup of coffee, spotless floors that have been recently vacuumed and the house set to the perfect temperature.
试想一下，你一觉醒来，就有一杯刚煮好的滚烫咖啡，地板被打扫得一尘不染，室温也调节得恰到好处。

8
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:57,580
With smart devices, these things can happen while you sleep.
有了智能设备，这些事情在你熟睡时就能完成。

9
00:00:57,580 --> 00:01:04,870
The potential to pre-program and automate parts of your life means that you can focus on other tasks in your life.
预先设定程序、将生活中的部分事务自动化，这种可能性意味着你可以把精力集中在生活中的其他事情上。

10
00:01:04,870 --> 00:01:09,330
But there is a difference between smart devices and AI.
但智能设备和人工智能之间存在区别。

11
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:18,780
Smart devices are the things that get on with the tasks, while AI can ‘think’ or interact, and can be used to control the smart devices.
智能设备是执行具体任务的工具，而人工智能能够“思考”或与人互动，还可以用来控制智能设备。

12
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:25,280
There are many voice-activated AI systems which can control the smart devices around your home.
市面上有许多声控人工智能系统，能够操控家中的各类智能设备。

13
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:32,730
You can ask these devices to start making coffee, dim the lights when they’re too bright or even make sure the house is secure.
你可以吩咐它们煮咖啡、在灯光太亮时调暗亮度，甚至让它们确保家居安全。

14
00:01:32,730 --> 00:01:42,410
You can inquire as to the weather outside, ask them to blare out music or search the internet for you when you have a burning question about history or the latest cooking recipes.
你可以询问室外天气，让它们播放音乐，或是在你对某个历史问题充满好奇、想找最新食谱时，让它们帮你搜索互联网。

15
00:01:42,410 --> 00:01:49,580
Some of these devices even have a sense of humour, and upon asking them certain questions, they will retort.
有些这类设备甚至还带有幽默感，当你向它们提出特定问题时，它们会给出俏皮的回应。

16
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:53,470
In short, in some ways, they can act as company.
简而言之，在某种程度上，它们可以充当陪伴者的角色。

17
00:01:53,470 --> 00:01:56,460
But how far will it go?
但人工智能的发展会走向何方呢？

18
00:01:56,460 --> 00:02:11,810
Well, we already have self-driving cars and sentient tech that can automatically order the delivery of certain products to restock our fridge when we’re running low, but often in films and games we see humanoid robots taking over all of the domestic duties.
目前，我们已经拥有了自动驾驶汽车，还有具备感知能力的技术——当冰箱里的食材不足时，它能自动下单订购相关商品进行补货。不过在电影和游戏中，我们经常看到人形机器人包揽所有家务的场景。

19
00:02:11,810 --> 00:02:18,700
It seems for now, that those things only live in our imaginations, but we could be seeing them sooner than we think.
眼下，这些景象似乎还只存在于想象之中，但说不定我们离见到它们的日子，比预想的要早得多。
